      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "login route sends the nonce as `state` and sets it in a cookie\n(HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Path=/auth, 10 min, cleared on every\ncallback). It binds the callback to the browser that started\nthe flow (login CSRF, ADR-0007).",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "login route sends the nonce as `state` and sets it in a cookie\n(HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Path=/auth, 10 min, cleared on every\ncallback). It binds the callback to the browser that started\nthe flow (login CSRF, ADR-0007).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10.66
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c3eca535a84e7fb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 491.4,
      "height": 70.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
